    {
      "id": 3,
      "title": "成功率",
      "type": "stat",
      "description": "当前窗口样本中 result=success 的比例。与 M-10 网关请求口径不同，不可直接对账。",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "postgres",
        "uid": "sub2api-pg"
      },
      "gridPos": {
