      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "html",
        "content": "<div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;flex-wrap:wrap;font-size:11px\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;width:10px;height:10px;background:#3987e5;border-radius:2px;margin-right:5px\"></span><span style=\"color:#b9c0c8;margin-right:16px\">读取请求体</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;width:10px;height:10px;background:#1aa57a;border-radius:2px;margin-right:5px\"></span><span style=\"color:#b9c0c8;margin-right:16px\">槽位等待</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;width:10px;height:10px;background:#e07a3f;border-radius:2px;margin-right:5px\"></span><span style=\"color:#b9c0c8;margin-right:16px\">网关本地</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;width:10px;height:10px;background:#d4a72c;border-radius:2px;margin-right:5px\"></span><span style=\"color:#b9c0c8;margin-right:16px\">上游耗时</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;width:10px;height:10px;background:#d9669a;border-radius:2px;margin-right:5px\"></span><span style=\"color:#b9c0c8;margin-right:16px\">响应传输</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;width:10px;height:10px;background:#9085e9;border-radius:2px;margin-right:5px\"></span><span style=\"color:#b9c0c8;margin-right:16px\">收尾</span><span style=\"color:#5f6872\">6 段互斥，之和等于总耗时；TTFT（headers_end）与上游段重叠，不参与堆叠。</span></div>",
        "codeLanguage": "plaintext",
